  "id": "sweet-potato-and-apple-sausage-casserole",
  "name": "Sweet Potato and Apple Sausage Casserole",
  "subtitle": "Roasted sweet potatoes, apples, and sliced chicken sausage",
  "description": "A savory-sweet baked casserole combining tender sweet potatoes, tart apples, apple chicken sausage, and honey mustard.",
